      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "……じいさん、幻獣だったのか。\r\n７００年の別離って、どういうことだ？",
        "official_en": "...So you’re an esper. But what do you mean by “seven centuries of longing”?",
        "real_en": "Wait... Old man, you were an Eidolon? What do you mean by seven hundred years of separation?"
      },
